batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (形式理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\)</span> (provability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e26933a629751c0c\" href=\"?note=e26933a629751c0c\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md\">../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" href=\"?note=a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md\">../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}_S\\)</span> (Hilbert–Bernays conjunction predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB1}_S,\\mathrm{HB2}_S,\\mathrm{HB3}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HB1}_S,\\mathrm{HB2}_S,\\mathrm{HB3}_S\\)</span> (Hilbert-Bernays clause predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays\\text{-}conditions} \\vdash \\mathrm{HB}_S(T,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{HB1}_S(T,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{HB2}_S(T,\\varphi,\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{HB3}_S(T,\\varphi)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays\\text{-}conditions} \\vdash \\mathrm{HB}_S(T,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{HB1}_S(T,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{HB2}_S(T,\\varphi,\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{HB3}_S(T,\\varphi)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays\\text{-}conditions} \\vdash \\mathrm{HB1}_S(T,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow \\bigl((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\to(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays\\text{-}conditions} \\vdash \\mathrm{HB1}_S(T,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow \\bigl((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\to(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays\\text{-}conditions} \\vdash \\mathrm{HB2}_S(T,\\varphi,\\psi)\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays\\text{-}conditions} \\vdash \\mathrm{HB2}_S(T,\\varphi,\\psi)\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays\\text{-}conditions} \\vdash \\mathrm{HB3}_S(T,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\urcorner)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays\\text{-}conditions} \\vdash \\mathrm{HB3}_S(T,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\urcorner)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>(D1) Reflection: if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(T \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span>, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\vdash \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(T \\vdash \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li>(D2) Boxed modus ponens: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\vdash \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\to \\psi \\urcorner) \\to \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\">\\(T \\vdash \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\to \\psi \\urcorner) \\to \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li>(D3) Introspection: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\vdash \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\urcorner)\">\\(T \\vdash \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>These conditions characterize formal provability predicates (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e26933a629751c0c\" href=\"?note=e26933a629751c0c\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md\">../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md</a>).</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md","status":"resolved","id":"e26933a629751c0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md","status":"resolved","id":"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (signature, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (formula set, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md","status":"resolved","id":"e26933a629751c0c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)$ (provability predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md","status":"resolved","id":"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","locatio